  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_IGiveTMFling",
      "en_US": [
        "Money can buy a lot of things.\n",
        "But can it buy muscles?!\r",
        "I want people to think about that.\r",
        "That’s why I give away the Technical\n",
        "Machine Bulk Up.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_ExplainFling",
      "en_US": [
        "Using that move, the Pokémon bulks\n",
        "up its body.\r",
        "It raises both its Attack and its\n",
        "Defense.\r",
        "Remember, a TM works only once, so\n",
        "choose its Pokémon with care."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_CatchingMadeMeHappy",
      "en_US": [
        "When I first started fishing, catching\n",
        "anything made me happy.\r",
        "But those days are long gone now...\r",
        "Now I get annoyed if I can’t beat my\n",
        "record by even an inch..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_MoreAgitatedAtNight",
      "en_US": [
        "I can’t explain it.\n",
        "I get more easily agitated at night."
      ]
    },
